sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Platform IME
    participant F as OneTextInputField
    participant M as TextEditingModel
    participant A as ImeCommitArbiter.Shared
    Note over P,A: value "안녕", composing 한, user presses ㄱ. macOS commits 한 as a char and starts composing ㄱ in one keystroke.
    Note over F: UpdateEditing polls the IME BEFORE the key queue is drained
    P->>F: composition report "ㄱ"
    F->>M: SetComposition("ㄱ")
    M->>M: report changed: _replaced = "한", _replacedThisUpdate = true, _handedOver = ""
    Note over M: composition is now ㄱ at Start = caret - 한 is not in the value yet
    F->>M: Tick()
    M->>M: _replacedThisUpdate -> false (register survives this Tick)
    M->>A: Tick() (Idle, returns null)
    Note over F: key queue drained
    P->>F: key event char '한' (no keycode)
    F->>F: composing, printable char: not the IME's key
    F->>M: AcceptCharacter('한')
    M->>A: ShouldSwallow('한')
    A-->>M: false (Idle, no platform commit registered)
    M->>M: Insert("한"): InsertAtCaret moves _composition.Start past 한
    M->>M: NoteHandedOver('한')
    alt _replaced == "한" and "한" TextStartsWith the payment so far
        M->>M: _paidTheReplaced = "한", return. Composition ㄱ stays owed.
    else register already aged out (char arrived a poll late)
        M->>M: _handedOver = "한" is not a prefix of "ㄱ": dropped, composition ㄱ stays
    end
    Note over M: Text = 안녕한, DisplayText = 안녕한ㄱ, Composition = ㄱ
    Note over M: if instead the char had equalled the live composition (SameText), NoteHandedOver ends it, IgnoreReplayOf + NotePlatformCommitted
